            "review_title": "Review at Pho Ong Hung Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Amy C\n17 contributions\n0\nNot Enjoyable\nAug 2016 • Friends\nMy friend and I went to Pho Ong Hung as it was recommended to us by a food tour guide the previous day. When we walked in we were seated near the kitchen and then left for a while. We had to ask to order our drinks, and then ask again to order our food as the staff kept walking past. My drink (a soft drink) was served warm to me and we both did not finish our Pho as it was average. This is uncommon for us as we both love food and hate waste. Unfortunately, I wouldn't recommend it.\nRead more\nWritten August 19, 2016",
