            "review_text": "Mirage T\n291 contributions\n0\nPoor service! The worst Pho ever!\nJan 2016 • Couples\nWe had just come here for lunch and experienced the worst service ever. Staffs are there for talking to each other ONLY and don't even pay attention to my orders. My iced tea is plain like water, tea supposed to have a bit yellow color but this is a total plain transparent color. Pho arrived cold, and i mean real cold. They make me wait for so long for my bill because there is no one there for me to ask for bill, they are all busy chity chatty in the kitchen!!! Lazy staffs, slow in response, cold face like they are not happy with their jobs or something. Never ever come here again!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 20, 2016",
